# Contributing to {{ project_title }}

## Bootstrap

    git clone <repo-url>
    cd <project>
    npm run contribute

## Linting and testing

    pnpm check

## Updating from the template

    uv run --group dev copier update --trust

Conflicts appear as `.rej` files; resolve and commit.

## License headers

The template renders no SPDX headers. `reuse annotate`, run at the first
commit, stamps each file's license.
